# Force CRLF for the VBS forwarder on checkout.
# This file is NOT merely style-sensitive: Windows Script Host rejects LF-only
# with 800A0401 and never runs it, which silently breaks every toast click.
# `text eol=crlf` normalises to LF in the index and restores CRLF on checkout,
# so the working tree always gets the form wscript needs.
*.vbs text eol=crlf

# PowerShell reads either ending fine, but keep the authored bytes as-is.
*.ps1 -text
